    <string name="about_title">About Python King</string>
    <string name="about_text">Python King runs a real Python 3.13 interpreter inside the app, fully offline.\n\nInstalled libraries: numpy, pillow (PIL), matplotlib.\n\nWrite a script that builds frames and hands each one to kinganim.show(...), then use Run Animation and Export to save it as MP4, GIF, PDF or PNG.\n\nEverything is saved to Downloads/PythonKing.\n\nNo ads. No tracking. No internet needed.</string>
